Session data is present locally, so I can test the main hypothesis directly. The 08-09 winning session contains many `side_source:"favorite_lane"` exits; post-08-10 sessions can be separated by `favorite_lane`, `rsi_fade`, exit reason, and size to see which change has enough magnitude.
