## Ranked Verdict

1. **`risk.favorite_lane_enabled: false`** in [config/settings.yaml](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/config/settings.yaml:2503)  
   **Most likely active regression.** Mechanism: **ADMISSION**. It hot-kills `_favorite_lane_signals()` in [bitcoin.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/bitcoin.py:5354) and [sol_macro.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/sol_macro.py:7528).  
   Evidence: winning session `test_20260809_223821` favorites were **61 exits, 85.2% WR, +$160.97**. Non-favorites alone were **49 exits, 40.8% WR, -$68.05**. Killing favorites leaves exactly the coinflip/negative native book.

2. **`risk.rsi_fade.enabled` experiment plus code-side exemptions**  
   Current config has it off, but it explains the 08-10/08-11 fade damage while enabled. Mechanism: **SIDE SELECTION + ADMISSION**. It flips LONG/SHORT at RSI extremes in [bitcoin.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/bitcoin.py:654) and [sol_macro.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/sol_macro.py:1800), then bypasses normal edge/conviction gates at [bitcoin.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/bitcoin.py:4298) and [sol_macro.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/sol_macro.py:6583).  
   Evidence: `rsi_fade` exits after 08-10: **80 trades, 43.8% WR, -$102.82**. Keep [config/settings.yaml](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/config/settings.yaml:2504) `enabled:false`; hard revert the code if you want no latent re-enable risk.

3. **Favorite size rollback/taper: `favorite_lane.size_usd: 25`, `size_taper_enabled: true`, `trading.max_position_size: 40`**  
   Mechanism: **SIZING**, not WR. In 08-09, favorites were effectively ~$70 notional and produced the whole session edge. Current settings at [config/settings.yaml](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/config/settings.yaml:2368) and [config/settings.yaml](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/config/settings.yaml:2369) would downsize that positive contributor even if favorites are re-enabled.  
   Revert for 08-09 economics: `favorite_lane.size_usd: 70.0`, `size_taper_enabled:false`, and likely `trading.max_position_size:80`.

4. **`favorite_lane.fav_net_sit_out_avg: -1.0`**  
   Mechanism: **ADMISSION**. Could suppress some winning favorite lanes via [bitcoin.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/bitcoin.py:5446) and [sol_macro.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/strategies/sol_macro.py:7633).  
   Lower confidence because it is currently masked by `risk.favorite_lane_enabled:false`, and the direct observed post-kill issue is no favorites at all. Revert by removing it or setting it `null`.

5. **`trading.exit_rules.hold_mfe_conditional_stop_enabled: true`**  
   Mechanism: possible **EXIT CLASH**, but lower confidence. It replaces window-based early-stop behavior with MFE-based shallow cuts in [live_testing.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/execution/live_testing.py:550) and fires via [live_testing.py](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/src/execution/live_testing.py:1641).  
   It can reduce WR if never-green false-cuts later recoverers, but current evidence does not beat the favorite-kill and RSI-fade evidence. Revert key: `hold_mfe_conditional_stop_enabled:false`.

6. **`tp_giveback_enabled`**  
   Not a culprit in current config: [config/settings.yaml](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/config/settings.yaml:463) is `false`. When it fired in later sessions, it was net positive: `test_20260811_044232` had `take_profit_giveback` **16 exits, 81% WR, +$30.08**. Do not rank as regression cause.

7. **`regime_fade.enabled:true`**  
   Lowest evidence. I found no closed exits with `side_source` containing `fade_native` in the checked 08-10/08-11 sessions. Revert key if needed: [config/settings.yaml](/Users/mainfolder/Documents/psb-main%201/config/settings.yaml:585) `regime_fade.enabled:false`.

## Highest-Confidence Revert

Set **`risk.favorite_lane_enabled: true`**. To restore the actual 08-09 winning behavior, also restore the favorite sizing geometry: **`favorite_lane.size_usd: 70.0`**, **`size_taper_enabled:false`**, and **`trading.max_position_size:80`**.
